tore_item_assets/steam/apps/3807980/extras/bd99b09abbf1f598035785665af140f6.mp4?t=1751624555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike classic bullet hell shooters, here <strong>YOU</strong> decide how your attack looks. Place emitters, adjust patterns using sliders, and create unique projectile sequences to dominate the battlefield! You can modify your patterns in real time to adapt to new enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807980/extras/022faed4ba727b378bf1eb5ba374d56f.poster.avif?t=1751624555\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807980/extras/022faed4ba727b378bf1eb5ba374d56f.mp4?t=1751624555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each wave, you gain experience \u2014 level up and choose from powerful upgrades to enhance your tower or emitters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Sample Upgrade System:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower Reinforcement</strong> \u2013 increases your tower's max health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emitter Spikes</strong> \u2013 damage enemies that come close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Electric Aura</strong> \u2013 zaps nearby enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reflective Shield</strong> \u2013 returns a portion of damage to the attacker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Railgun</strong> \u2013 a powerful beam that pierces everything in its path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emitter Fortification</strong> \u2013 emitters become obstacles that block enemy movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Auto-Repair</strong> \u2013 your tower regenerates health over time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Game Modes Available in Demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal Mode</strong> \u2013 a classic survival mode to test your patterns and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Story, Sandbox, and Survival modes are available only in the full version.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2728 Demo Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller support</strong> (gamepad), mouse and keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique pattern editor</strong> \u2013 bullet hell attacks created with sliders!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Save and load your patterns</strong> (shareable via JSON).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time pattern editing</strong> during combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower and emitter upgrade system.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike elements</strong> with high replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro graphics</strong> inspired by 90s <strong>SHMUP</strong> (Shoot 'em up) style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Auto-battler</strong> with <strong>special active skills</strong> \u2014 mines, time-slowing, sniper shot, and more, triggered via hotkeys and aimed directly at enemies or zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time control</strong> \u2013 speed up or slow down the game to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Projectiles <strong>can have different patterns and colors</strong> \u2013 like pink!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\uddea Demo Limitations:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo ends after <strong>wave 10</strong> \u2013 the full version continues beyond that and includes a <strong>final boss</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story, Sandbox, and Survival modes</strong> are not included in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo will not receive future content updates</strong> \u2013 new abilities, artifacts, and features will be exclusive to the full version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a taste of <strong>Pattern Survivors</strong> and lets you explore its core mechanics and chaos! The full version offers many more modes, features, and depth \u2014 add it to your wishlist if you like</p>","developers":["Airem"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3787880","name":"Pattern Survivors: Bullet Hell (Roguelike / Roguelite)"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807980/ddaf38fd80f83410e2606ea1578819913374fc35/header.jpg?t=1751624555","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia &amp; AMD (512MB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> But please check demo!</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux 64 bit Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3570K or AMD FX-8320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia &amp; AMD (1GB VRAM) or legendary GeForce GTX 1060 8GB or RTX 3060 TI<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> But please check demo!</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb